Here "mi" attempts to create a list of reasons why certain changes/additions and artifacts in lojban exist, so help people explain and understand the language as is. This should also prevent history from repeatting itself. For a list of common beginner mistake faq database see ((common beginner mistake faq database)).

--

==Why does .y. exist?==

((The god R))

Apparently it started with Loglan which had an unofficial "drag" character rrr, which eventually got incorperated with the language. From then Lojban was developed, using Y. (Folk law, until someone corrects it.)